      "content": "it's just so tiring. the pretending, the walking around, all the effort to be a \"person.\" if everything is this hollow and nothing is actually solid, what's the point of all that effort? it feels like i'm just dragging this heavy, fake body around for no reason. it would be so much quieter if i could just... not have to do this anymore.",
